rem Red, Green, and Blue Tiles
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=117
rem Count the ways to tile a row with
rem grey squares and tiles of length 2,
rem 3 and 4

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Size integer = 50

rem Take b, c, d tiles of lengths 2, 3,
rem 4; a grey squares fill the rest.
rem Order the a + b + c + d pieces in
rem any way: a multinomial, as a product
rem of binomials.
HB = Size // 2
HC = Size // 3
HD = Size // 4
B = (0 to HB array) reshape (HB + 1) 1 1
C = (0 to HC array) reshape 1 (HC + 1) 1
D = (0 to HD array) reshape 1 1 (HD + 1)
Grey = Size - B * 2 - C * 3 - D * 4
Fits = Grey at least 0
A = Fits choose Grey 0
Pieces = A + B + C + D
Rest' = B + C + D
Mix' = C + D
First' = Pieces A binomial
Second' = Rest B binomial
Third' = Mix C binomial
Ways' = First * Second * Third
Answer = (Fits choose Ways 0) sum
Answer print
